In fact, an order dated 5 July, 2024 passed by  the Collector Diu, Bhanu Prabha to that effect is placed on record, which  reads as under :
 ORDER WHEREAS, an award under Section 31 of RFCTLARR Act, 2013 has been passed by the Land Acquisition Officer, Diu on 26/04/2021 for Land acquisition for Promenade Development for Diu Town from Diu Bus Station up to Fort, Diu;
AND WHEREAS, as per the award under Section 31 of the Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act, 2013, your family is entitled to suitable housing as part of the Rehabilitation and Resettlement entitlement;
Savita Rasiklal Mandan And Anr vs Union Of India And Anr on 8 August, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/46673144/
3 8 August, 2024 4.WP3969_2021.DOC AND WHEREAS, your family has been identified as displaced due to the acquisition of land under the provisions of the Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act, 2013;
AND WHEREAS, in compliance with the above Act and after due assessment, it has been decided to allot a house to your family;
Now THEREFORE, you are requested to take possession of the allotted house with immediate effect and hand over peaceful possession of property bearing PTS No. 63/2-A-3 &amp; PTS No. 63/2- A-6.
